		(at 120 112)
		(descr "ESP32-H2 SuperMini (24 x 18.4 mm) raised on 2x9 header pins or female headers, 2.54 mm pitch, rows 15.24 mm apart (ASSUMED - measure the real board before ordering). Pin order from Zektopic/esp32-h2-supermini-kicad (top view, USB end at bottom, antenna end at top). Courtyard covers only the pin rows: parts under the module must stay below ~1.5 mm (header pins) so the USB plug and module clear them. Interior pads (IO22/25/26/27) and B+/B- not used.")
